<title>USA: First Financial Holdings Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>First Financial Holdings Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>			 Dec. 31, 1996  Dec. 31, 1995  Sep 30, 1996</p>
<p> Interest income	$    29,685    $   26,556     $  29,094</p>
